window.products.push({"id":122445,"name":"Ice Makers Countertop, 9 Cubes Ready in 5 Mins, 30lbs in 24Hrs, Portable Ice Maker Machine with Ice Scoop and Basket, Bullet-Shaped Ice for Home/Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ruafAur8L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Never Run Out of Ice Again! - The NORTHCLAN Ice Makers Countertop produce 9 ice cubes in JUST 5-8 minutes, with a maximum capacity of 30 pounds per day. Say goodbye to constantly buying ice bags and save 100 bucks every month. NORTHCLAN is also energy-efficient, using 33% less electricity compared to other brands. Easy Operation for Convenience - With its simple control panel, the NORTHCLAN ice maker is a breeze to use. Fill the water tank with 2L of water and press the ON button - it's that simple. The transparent lid allows you to monitor the ice capacity, while the IR sensor alerts you when the ice is full or if you need to add water. The portable design operates quietly at less than 35 decibels, like a working refrigerator. Compact and Powerful - The NORTHCLAN ice machine maker countertop is lightweight, weighing only 17.09 pounds, and has a compact size of 11.81H11.41D8.66W (in). Equipped with advanced condensing technology and a silent fan, it can quickly and quietly freeze water into ice. No installation is required with its free-standing design. Prioritizing Health and Safety - The NORTHCLAN countertop ice maker's interior is made of white food-grade pure material with no odor, ensuring your health and safety. The bullet-shaped ice cubes have a soft texture to chew and a slow melting speed, preserve drink flavor longer than nugget ice and chill drinks faster than round or cube ice. Easy to Clean - The NORTHCLAN Ice Cube Maker is effortless to clean with just a damp cloth. Its compact size also makes it easy to move and drain water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ruafAur8L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORTHCLAN","source_asin":"B0BKRNBM8S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKRNBM8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKRNBM8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
