window.products.push({"id":122534,"name":"VANSTON 12\" Built-in Gas Cooktop,2 Italy SABAF Sealed Burners Gas Rangetop 18,000BTU, NG/LPG Convertible, Dual Burner Stainless Steel Gas Stovetop wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iUzbujL2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【304 Stainless Steel Finish】Surface constructed with 304 stainless steel, resists stain, heat, discoloration and easy to clean. 2 sealed burners prevent food from falling into them. You only simply remove the grates and then just wipe it with a damp towel. 【Two High Efficiency SABAF Burner】Vanston 12'' built-in gas cooktop offers you 2 World Class Made in Italy SABAF different multi-functional burners with a dual ring 12,000-BTU burner and a 6,000-BTU burner. These two powerful burners can meet your different cooking requirements, like simmerig, braising, frying, stir-frying, roasting, steaming, boiling, melting or caramelizing. 【Solid & Thoughtful Design】The heavy-duty flat cast-iron cooking grates is perfect to keep the pot stable. 2 durable melt-proof bakelite knobs can respectively control 2 burners, so you can cook 2 menus in the same time and reduce your parperation time for the dinner or party. 【NG/LPG Convertible】The gas cooktop delivers same power to propane and natural gas (Default Natural gas). Capable for multi-purpose such as RVs, light cooking family, small kitchen, etc. (Both Natural Gas Regulator and LPG Nozzles included). 【Thermocouple Protection & CSA Certification】The 12 inches NG/LPG gas stove-top is CSA certified.With FFD, the two burner gas cooktop will shutoff the gas automatically if a flame is not detected to ensure your safety in an emergency. Please verify the cooktop is the right size for you. Product size: 12.2\" W x 20.\"D x 3.9\"H, Cut out size: 11.2\" W x 19.1\"D. Pre-installed 120v power cord.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iUzbujL2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANSTON","source_asin":"B0C9SXM8RG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C9SXM8RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C9SXM8RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":122535,"name":"Waterdrop Plus MSWF Refrigerator Water Filter, 𝐑𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐏𝐅𝐀𝐒, Replacement for GE® MSWF, 101820A, 101821B, RWF1500A, 1 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g5PbSDg2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This filter is replacement for GE MSWF! Please double check if you need is MSWF! [Replacement for filter models] GE MSWF, 101820/A, 101820A, 101821-B, 101821B. 238C2334P003, AP3997949, MSWF3PK, MSWFDS, PC46783, PS1559689, WR02X12345, WR02X12801, RWF1062, CF12, PF12, This filter is not sourced by or sponsored by GE. WR17X11608; GE SIDE-BY-SIDE AND FRENCH-DOOR REFRIGERATORS; WR02X12345; WR02X12801. [Authoritative Certifications] Dedicated to providing pure and healthy drinking water, Waterdrop, a world-famous water purification brand, has been trusted by over 6 million American families. Waterdrop's high-quality replacement filters, from every component to the whole filter, have been certified by NSF and IAPMO against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42 and 372 standards for effective reduction of 35 substances, ensuring high-quality drinking water. [Comprehensive Certifications] This filter has been strictly certified against NSF/ANSI 401 for reduction of 99.2% of bisphenol A, phenytoin, estrone, ibuprofen and naproxen and against NSF/ANSI 53 for reduction of 99.6% of lead, 96.6% of benzene and 92.3% of mercury. It is certified by IAPMO for reduction of 20 harmful substances like 99.59% of ethylbenzene, over 99% of trimethoprim, 2,4 D, Lindane, MTBE and atrazine. Furthermore, it can reduce PFOA and PFOS according to testing. [Deep filtration] Waterdrop's refrigerator filters significantly reduce the levels of many different harmful substances in your water, including a 95.3% reduction in PFOA and PFOS tested by the third-party laboratory. Moreover, the filter additionally allows through many of the beneficial minerals in water that are essential for health. [Fast water flow, no leaks] Our mission is to supply refrigerator water filters that fit perfectly, impeccably engineered; this sets us apart from inferior models of replacement filters that can frequently result in water leakage problems. The microscopic pore sizes in our filter cartridges, made of superior materials, allow for smooth running, crisp, pure water. [Carefully chosen materials] Waterdrop uses coconut shell carbon blocks supplied from Sri Lanka that have enlarged surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon blocks. The filter cartridge is far more effective in reducing levels of chlorine, dirt, sediment, rust, and a wide range of heavy metals tested by a third-party laboratory. Based on our high attention to detail, we selected a BPA-free, food-grade housing for the filter that exceeds NSF 372 lead-free filtration certification. [Regular filter changes] If you run replacement filter past the recommended date, something could accumulate and filtration performance could suffer. Because of this, we supply a complimentary set of installation stickers with every filter so that you can see at a glance when it needs replacing. We recommend that you should replace your filter after it has been used for 300 gallons or 6 months (this may vary dependent on the water condition in your area). [Professional standards] Our expert teams pride themselves on not letting any product or part of a product, down to the smallest components, leave our factory unless we are satisfied that they have reached and exceeded the very highest market standards. Our dedication doesn't just apply within the factory: we have a customer service team ready to answer your questions and deal with any problems 24/7. [More than just a business] Waterdrop is passionate about providing clean water for as many people as possible with lower environmental impact. We use cowhide corrugated box packaging, reducing the wastage other companies create with their materials. A percentage of the purchase price from every one of our filters is used to fund projects providing clean, pure water for African children who don't have access to safe water supplies. GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g5PbSDg2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01GACANRG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GACANRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GACANRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
