window.products.push({"id":122562,"name":"Giantex Portable Washing Machine, Washer and Spinner Combo with Water Heating, 8 Programs 3 Water Levels and Built-In Drain Pump, 2 In 1 Compact Laund","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HwC-Q5fVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy Operation】: Designed with an easy-to-use control panel, this 2-in-1 washer has 8 programs satisfies your different washing needs. The ''normal'' program will take about 40 minutes. In addition, the 3 water levels (L/14L, M/21L, H/28L) allow you to adjust according to the number of clothes. 【Heating Function】: This full automatic laundry washer is equipped with a heating function which offers 4 different temperatures, such as 30°, 40°, 60° and 90° in order to remove stubborn stains and perfectly fit to wash baby’s clothes. 【Safe Protections】: Considering your children's safety, this compact washing machine comes with a child lock. When it is set and activated, all the keys will be locked to prevent kids from pressing them randomly. Besides, there is a special cover lock function to ensure your safety. 【24-Hour Delay Function】: This full automatic washing machine with 24 hours smart delay function allows you to pre-set the washing time of the clothes according to your needs. And the automatic unbalance detection corrects imbalance in the tub automatically. 【Compact Design】: Measuring 17.6'' x 17.8'' x 29.4'' (L x W x H) in dimension, this compact laundry washer will not take up too much of your space so that it is perfect for the limited space, such as apartment, dorm and RV to offer great convenience. Furthermore, the stainless steel honeycomb shaped inner tub can hold up to 7.7 lbs of clothes at once, saving your precious time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HwC-Q5fVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B0974LQ5K1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0974LQ5K1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0974LQ5K1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":122563,"name":"Magoog Washer Door Prop, Front Load Washer Door Prop, Keep Front Load Washer Door Open and Dry to Prevent Damping, Washer Door Holder for Front Load W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dFbHLf-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Washer Door Prop to Keep Front Load Washer Clean】Most of us prefer front load washing machine because it saves much water and clean clothes better. But drying the door gasket after laundry is annoying, and it may smell gradually. So, a washer door prop can be a saver for your front loading washing machine to keep it clean and fresh. 【Fits most Front Load Washers with Metal Door】Equipped with magnets on the both ends of Magoog front load washer prop, you can simply stick it to your front load washer door, keeping it open after laundry, improving inside air quality to prevent smelling. Note: It’s unnecessary to use the attached metal discs if your front load washing machine is made of metal material. 【What if My Front Load Washer Door is Not Metal?】If so, please use the attached 3* suction metal discs. First, tear off the disc’s sticker. Stick them to the door. Wait for 12 hours to make it better adhesive. Then, stick your washer door prop to the metal discs. Note: It’s unnecessary to use the attached metal discs if your front load washing machine is made of metal material. 【High Quality TPU Materials】Made of TPU material with high elongation and tensile strength, Magoog front load washing machine prop is equipped with excellent abrasion resistance. Will last a long time to protect your front load washer. Magoog is a trustworthy seller on Amazon and specializes in offering great value tools for the home, garden and workplace. If there is any unsatisfactory issues, please contact us first. We can find a solution and make it satisfactory.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dFbHLf-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magoog","source_asin":"B0BHSNH61B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSNH61B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSNH61B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
