window.products.push({"id":122622,"name":"Fisher Paykel RF201ADX5 20.1 cu. ft. Bottom Freezer French Door Refrigerator","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HUWigWTxL._AC_.jpg","description":"This refrigerator has been designed to maximize space as well as access. French Door refrigerators bring theater into the kitchen with unobstructed access to wide-open shelf spaces. Below a spacious full-extension drawer and storage bins provide ergonomic solutions for freezer items.Fresher Food for Longer Fruit and vegetable quality can be maintained at the right humidity and temperature level. The Humidity Control System together with the cool and consistent temperature delivered by ActiveSmart Foodcare creates the perfect microclimate in each produce bin. Two humidity control slides offer settings for both fruit and vegetables to retain optimal moisture and freshness.Easy Living These refrigerators adapt to suit your lifestyle by streamlining food preparation and organization with SmartTouch controls flexible shelving and storage options and slide out bins and trays.Sized to Suit Available in multiple widths these refrigerators are sized to suit families and kitchens large and small. Designed to fit easily in your kitchen they can sit flush with your counter top. Concealed hinges on many models add to a clean refined appearance.Ergonomic Uninterrupted wide-open spaces and numerous shelving options enable easy customization for different uses. Quality extension runners allow you to slide out trays fully for easy loading and unloading in the refrigerator and freezer. The storage bins are also removable making food preparation and cleaning easier.Easy Cleaning Removable spill safe glass shelves are easy to clean and contain drips and spills. Storage bins and EZKleen stainless steel doors just need a wipe to keep spotless.Efficient Alarms on the refrigerator and freezer alert you if the door has been left open. Adaptive defrost means that there is no need for holiday mode settings. ActiveSmart will select the best time to defrost based on how the appliance is being used. When you are away it will recognise lower levels of use and defrost less often there","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HUWigWTxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fisher & Paykel","source_asin":"B00NCRVK6Q","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NCRVK6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NCRVK6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
