window.products.push({"id":122684,"name":"Egg Holder for Refrigerator Drawer - Fridge Egg Drawer Organizer with Whisk Fridge Egg Holder with Silicone Wire Whisk Egg Trays for Refrigerator Egg ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513WvVoH-uL._AC_.jpg","description":"【PULL OUT Egg Drawer with Whisk】- The set comes with 1 Pack of refrigerator egg drawer and 1 Pack of silicone wire whisk. The extended handle of egg holder makes it easy to pull in and out, which is convenient when storing egg. The egg drawers slide out without removing entire bracket. Clear material design keeps food items visible and easy to locate. Easy installation, no tools required. The wire whisk is covered in silicone to prevent damage to pans with a stainless steel handle for comfort. 【Please Note】- Please make sure that the length of your refrigerator shelf is between 11.8-16.5 inches, and the thickness of the shelf must be under 0.6 inches. The fridge egg drawer size: L11.8\" x W 7.9\" x H 2\", the upper part has a smooth spring pull rod design, which can freely adjust the length of the railing. The length of the slide rail can be extended from 11.8 inches to 16.5 inches. The egg holder can fit most standard size refrigerators. 【Premium Material】- The fridge egg organizer is made of food grade PET plastic, which is BPA free, non-toxic, durable, smooth edges and safe to use. The pull-out fridge egg holder drawer keeps eggs handy and out of the way, ideal for organizing your refrigerator. The wire whisk is made of BPA free silicone and stainless steel, which is solid and heat resistant up to 450 degrees Fahrenheit, perfect for cooking almost any meal. 【AUTOMATIC ROLLING】 - The automatic rolling curve design is easy to take, after removing an egg at the front, the egg at the back will automatically roll up. The refrigerator drawer organizer is perfect for organizing eggs in the fridge. The egg holder for refrigerator can keep your eggs fresh for longer periods and better protected without damage or break. 【Space Saver】- The egg organizer for refrigerator is convenient to use in fridge, freezers, kitchen cabinets. It is a great way to add storage and organize, ideal for sort and store eggs. Also great for holding small fruits and vegetables. If you are not happy with the product for any reason, please do not hesitate to contact us. All issues will be solved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513WvVoH-uL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Farochy","source_asin":"B0B68GGQXT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B68GGQXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B68GGQXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
