window.products.push({"id":122748,"name":"Durable Stack Kit for Standard & Long Vent Dryer - W10869845","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X2qIRNIrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACE SAVING STACK SET - Conserve space in your laundry area with this durable stacking kit. This dry vent kit allows you to stack your laundry units to fit in closets. You can easily put your dryer on top of your washer to free up some extra space in the laundry room of your apartment or home. Aside from it being a space-saver, you can also save your money from buying a new appliances washer dryer when you stack the old one to your washer. WIDE COMPATIBILITY - The Appliance Pros AP6047938 Durable Washer Dryer Stack Kit is highly designed for various top models -The W10869845 Dryer Stacking Kit fits for Whirlpool, Kenmore, Amana, Maytag dryers. Replaces part numbers: 4502692, AP6047938, PS12069913, EAP12069913, MED5630HW0, MHW5630HC0, MHW5630HW0, MHW6630HC0, MHW6630HW0, NFW5800HW0, WED5620HW0, WED6620HC0, WED6620HW0, WED8620HC0, WED8620HW0, WED9620HBK0, 1105902800, 11069132410, 11069133410, 110C68132410, etc. COMPLETE SET - Each washer dryer stacked unit includes four (4) washer feet, two (2) hooked brackets, two (2) plastic clips, and four (4) pan head screws to provide strong support for installation. HASSLE-FREE INSTALLATION - Designed for easier installation and service, this stacked washer dryer compact kit allows you to install and remove the dryer from top of the washer smoothly without moving the washer from its original location. An instruction manual is also included to provide a guide for convenient installation with only basic tools needed. PREMIUM QUALITY - Focused on resiliency and durability, this laundry stacking kit is guaranteed to outlast the life of your laundry machines. Each stacking set features a high quality material construction to offer a sturdy reinforcement, keeping your washer and dryer in place. This Stacking Kit replacement part has been quality tested and is backed by the Appliance Pros' 1 Year Limited Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X2qIRNIrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Appliance Pros","source_asin":"B07Y8VPJS7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y8VPJS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y8VPJS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
