window.products.push({"id":122981,"name":"WPW10448876 Washer Water-level Pressure Switch W10448876 Whirlpool Water Level PS11754877 WFW86HEBW2 MHW5100DW0 WFW94HEAW0 MHW7000AG0 WFW96HEAU0 MHW80","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VlvDj+sbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Water-Level Pressure Switch WPW10448876 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP6021553, W10448876, 2312075, PS11754877, WPW10448876VP. Water-Level Pressure Switch is compatible with Whirlpool, Maytag, Amana, Crosley, Kenmore. The primary function of the Whirlpool Wpw10448876 Pressure Switch is to detect the water level in the washing machine tub. It ensures that the appropriate amount of water is present for each cycle of the machine. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part #wpw10448876? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Wpw10448876 Washer Water Level Pressure Switch Replacement will help if your appliance doesn't drain or it doesn't fill with water. It is crucial to ensure compatibility with the appliance's make and model to ensure proper functioning and accurate water-level detection. 💡 The Whirlpool Front-load Washer Pressure Switch #wpw10448876 is an essential component in washing machines that rely on water level detection and control. It is responsible for monitoring the water level inside the appliance and signaling the control board when the desired water level has been reached or when there is a problem with the water level. Water-Level Pressure Switch meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 The switch uses air pressure to sense the water level. It is connected to an air dome or tube, which is in contact with the tub or the water-filled area. As the water level rises, the air pressure inside the dome or tube increases, and the pressure switch detects these changes. The Wpw10448876 Water-level Pressure Switch typically operates within a specific pressure range. It has different pressure settings or levels that correspond to different water levels. 💡 The Water-level Pressure Switch W10448876 is designed to detect faults or anomalies in the water level. If the switch detects an overfill or underfill condition, it sends a signal to the control board, which may trigger an error code or an alarm to alert the user of the issue. This helps prevent water-related problems such as flooding or inadequate water levels. The Wpw10448876 Pressure Switch may require calibration to ensure accurate water-level detection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VlvDj+sbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B09DL4GLKT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DL4GLKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DL4GLKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
