window.products.push({"id":122984,"name":"AMI PARTS Dryer Replacement Part Kit 3392519 Thermal Fuse 3387134 Cycling Thermostat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jYE48kCjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★★Welcome to AMI PARTS store , we wish you a good day. Please take a moment to read the following information before buying. ★★ SPECIFICATIONS: ◆ Package Includes: 1 * 3387134 dryer cycling thermostat. 2 * 3392519 dryer thermal fuse ◆ Parts Numbers: 3387134 dryer cycling thermostat. 1. Replaces Parts Numbers: 3387134 dryer cycling thermostat. 2. REPLACES PARTS: 306910, 3387134, 3387135, 3387139, WP3387134 3. Fixes Issues: No heat or not enough heat. Takes too long to dry. Too hot. Will Not Start. Shuts off too soon. Will not shut off. Timer will not advance. ◆ Parts Number: 3392519 dryer thermal fuse 1. Replaces parts numbers: 3388651, G4AP0500, 3392519, 694511, 80005, WP3392519VP, WP3392519, 21900, 214500, 39800. 2. Unsure about compatibility:Works with most top name brands,If you are not sure if part is correct, ask us in Customer questions & answers section or visiting the AMI PARTS storefront. We’re happy to help ensure you select the correct part for your dryer. 3. Fixes Issues: Will not start, no heat, will not tumble or timer does not advance. ★★ INSTALLATION TIPS: 1. Unplug the dryer before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands.  2. Disconnect your dryer from its power source before starting the repair. Before disconnecting any wires, take a picture so that you know how to reconnect everything at the end.  3. This is a one-time fuse, meaning it cannot be re-set. It must be replaced when there is no longer continuity between the terminals. It attaches to the blower wheel housing.  4. Blown fuses can be caused by clogged dryer vents. We recommend checking to make sure all of the vents are clear when you perform this repair.  ★★ PLEASE NOTE: The brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jYE48kCjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMI PARTS","source_asin":"B07S5QNGYW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-122984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S5QNGYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S5QNGYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
